  "speakers": [
    {
      "id": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "121/reference.wav",
        "text": "But that only made his little final auditory more compact and select, kept it, round the hearth, subject to a common thrill.",
        "duration_s": 7.94,
        "source_id": "121_127105_000042_000006",
        "sha256": "7d18187817a4c1793c4f9be49a00b8c32b3bed7adc1d8babc495e8e6e0226a03"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "237/reference.wav",
        "text": "\"Then, dear,\" said mrs Whitney, \"you must be kinder to her than ever; think what it would be for one of you to be away from home even among friends.\"",
        "duration_s": 8.06,
        "source_id": "237_126133_000007_000001",
        "sha256": "56e2caaddc20fe2feed8205d92fb1b2f97445d696fb1a7bcd32e0a07780ea219"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "3729/reference.wav",
        "text": "In order to please her, I spoke to her of the Abbe Conti, and I had occasion to quote two lines of that profound writer.",
        "duration_s": 7.89,
        "source_id": "3729_6852_000004_000003",
        "sha256": "fc29d7f943ab9f10eede3c97db778f25de210af01f264c901e48e2aac604b991"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "5142/reference.wav",
        "text": "Even some of the most strongly marked races cannot be identified with that degree of unanimity which might have been expected from what has been written on the subject.",
        "duration_s": 8.15,
        "source_id": "5142_36600_000008_000007",
        "sha256": "43e51667bac277f1b9b75e033284b5238c8924365ff15a6789fd12b7566eb41c"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "8555/reference.wav",
        "text": "Rich jewels of blue stones glittered upon their persons and the royal ladies were fully as gorgeous as they were haughty and overbearing.",
        "duration_s": 8.0,
        "source_id": "8555_284447_000020_000003",
        "sha256": "4795206cd8b21217026d16ab81f9d55c9e75ead9ba235cc38da410f0f83ed198"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "1089/reference.wav",
        "text": "So timeless seemed the grey warm air, so fluid and impersonal his own mood, that all ages were as one to him.",
        "duration_s": 8.01,
        "source_id": "1089_134691_000027_000002",
        "sha256": "431f4c22082d5b106ea74a0b3f15a322e3f953a213d527571d689427b947ee49"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "260/reference.wav",
        "text": "But when the pick was shipped again, Hans pointed out on its surface deep prints as if it had been violently compressed between two hard bodies.",
        "duration_s": 8.0,
        "source_id": "260_123286_000024_000000",
        "sha256": "56d6f3600e1abeac7dc595451857529ec2fefe01d1ce22a2134175d392f3efec"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "5639/reference.wav",
        "text": "The boy found his recovery in this house; and I found in it reminiscences of events I shall never forget as long as I live.",
        "duration_s": 7.99,
        "source_id": "5639_40744_000018_000003",
        "sha256": "8228691233ba61396cb0f59df93269f1ed170cfcb51ee753d6de22835f971f95"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "7729/reference.wav",
        "text": "During and after the contest over the speakership at Washington, each State Legislature became a forum of Kansas debate.",
        "duration_s": 7.890042,
        "source_id": "7729_102255_000021_000003",
        "sha256": "d18d578e3a504d1a9f23deb4d46da77624dd6a6c78e3fa6d929e303758a08191"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "reference": {
        "audio": "908/reference.wav",
        "text": "O life of this our spring! why fades the lotus of the water? Why fade these children of the spring?",
        "duration_s": 8.37,
        "source_id": "908_157963_000010_000000",
        "sha256": "57d92508f99a1f4252c8f2fa6a923edc0705d7a1a210c4d6390d49adb89c917f"
      }
    }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "spk-121-00",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Also, a popular contrivance whereby love making may be suspended but not stopped during the picnic season.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.84,
      "target_source_id": "121_121726_000004_000003",
      "target_sha256": "390202806881435873152baa53c2c1e943d8351d627c03077c60c2722c5b338d"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-01",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Also, a draft on futurity, sometimes honored, but generally extended.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.67,
      "target_source_id": "121_121726_000034_000001",
      "target_sha256": "953c6ca05a8d1a7763667d7ef1c2526d952baad5496b462ed208fc021012aec7"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-02",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "If the child gives the effect another turn of the screw, what do you say to TWO children-?\"",
      "target_audio": "121/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.78,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000008_000002",
      "target_sha256": "4b5076e372f40747a1f09601c37f4d15040db844e602be3363393d3597dda764"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-03",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"Oh, how delicious!\" cried one of the women.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.01,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000013_000000",
      "target_sha256": "5e877b7b18de8f9f63771079e86b81e949f2a6c76ad79b3a537606686ce11f00"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-04",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Then as he faced us again: \"I can't begin.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.92,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000016_000001",
      "target_sha256": "fb839499179520cded88b1eb9a3846b3edd5d2654293983179e91d8da767877e"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-05",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I took that HERE\"--he tapped his heart. \"I've never lost it.\"",
      "target_audio": "121/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.9,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000018_000001",
      "target_sha256": "a0ecdb8f22498cbeb3ef1f8125a2c97780ce8531e7d099ea726bc2b550dfc674"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-06",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Yes, she was in love. That is, she had been.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.72,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000024_000002",
      "target_sha256": "8d68b7ad57e1bfd4fe0740f51c00982b98116f8300ef6cb470a32f73b65eb852"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-07",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"Well, if I don't know who she was in love with, I know who HE was.\"",
      "target_audio": "121/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.7,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000036_000004",
      "target_sha256": "6fc8530372dd1f7541e7cc9345fbcc79786014ddd2ed4ece20790d6053712df3"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-08",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Then he became as communicative as we could desire and indeed gave us his best reason for being so.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.780042,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000042_000001",
      "target_sha256": "1c652367ad5084b3a584dbe2e6f74e4a56f7a94347823d6e2470c0dd4b4c8515"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-121-09",
      "speaker": "121",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The awkward thing was that they had practically no other relations and that his own affairs took up all his time.",
      "target_audio": "121/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.239958,
      "target_source_id": "121_127105_000044_000003",
      "target_sha256": "4863c823e81acb6c70e9d1f777c7dfa5b2cc410b9438149b235c13f9cf9b02d3"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-00",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "At night, when no one knew it, the tears would come racing over the poor, forlorn little face, and would not be squeezed back.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.96,
      "target_source_id": "237_126133_000002_000003",
      "target_sha256": "81503479ca39f4d79ae8c1013e87321379367f0309d0077938a263d9dc00cfb4"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-01",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "At this, the bundle opened suddenly, and-out popped Phronsie!",
      "target_audio": "237/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.35,
      "target_source_id": "237_126133_000021_000000",
      "target_sha256": "e56ddc628ab2e80c22cfc8be556821cb02ad8cdc5dbfb4823303e7b75e8065c7"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-02",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"Oh Phronsie!\" cried Polly, turning around at the last words; \"how could you!\"",
      "target_audio": "237/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.26,
      "target_source_id": "237_126133_000046_000000",
      "target_sha256": "36380a3ec3cb06b8aefdb5b5a5bd823d248f4e74fe2e43f76501872c7b34773a"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-03",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "From the Norwegian graveyard one looks out over a vast checker board, marked off in squares of wheat and corn; light and dark, dark and light.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 10.71,
      "target_source_id": "237_134493_000002_000004",
      "target_sha256": "e8ca9ec67663c672d7832731d339da3b5cddc704add4299bebc048176afffbe0"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-04",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The wind was flapping her big hat and teasing a curl of her chestnut colored hair.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.82,
      "target_source_id": "237_134493_000007_000004",
      "target_sha256": "5ba97538950d88079f6fc86d109a8876ba2fe8aa5c87d699d50e3b2f61a7d1d0"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-05",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "They drove westward toward Norway Creek, and toward a big white house that stood on a hill, several miles across the fields.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.16,
      "target_source_id": "237_134493_000021_000000",
      "target_sha256": "2bcba2278d09a2468362f7fe65874d3794173455f9a80b23848641b6329bae88"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-06",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Frank and Lou Bergson had very similar ideas, and they were two of the political agitators of the county.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.62,
      "target_source_id": "237_134500_000003_000004",
      "target_sha256": "b680ec5e196bb547539f609ac2ffe1f4f31e5b23ee8069e64af4a7dfde57b953"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-07",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The old people in the mountains plant lindens to purify the forest, and to do away with the spells that come from the old trees they say have lasted from heathen times.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.29,
      "target_source_id": "237_134500_000014_000001",
      "target_sha256": "dafd289202d5d5e714ebbf244c35f0ac4f592103036fa7772e0993ef3506ccfc"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-08",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Alexandra can run the farm all right, without me.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.8,
      "target_source_id": "237_134500_000029_000001",
      "target_sha256": "bbb949afc9cd3ff8cc1167faeb48f2aae1a5cc38bbc1addde646f22c7f17aabb"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-237-09",
      "speaker": "237",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Marie took up her cherries and went slowly toward the house, crying bitterly.",
      "target_audio": "237/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.669958,
      "target_source_id": "237_134500_000041_000001",
      "target_sha256": "517b2756e24a424469ac3c151fa40a936db2d01639857544869e479bb16548d9"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-00",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Baletti's father, who had just recovered from a long illness, was not with us, but we had his father's sister, who was older than Mario.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.72,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000003_000001",
      "target_sha256": "1719ae2bfb8180e2354dcd5af340fc3bda815c0cc84f32f128e8cf0ea5bde48b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-01",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "She held her tongue, but from that time she told everybody that I was an impostor.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.44,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000008_000001",
      "target_sha256": "6320a6bf2f24e7a1e9413f30a8e1ede063f7ad9467bc83a23b1c83c653ccb260"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-02",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "After his visit I told Esprit to take me to the Palais Royal, and I left him at the gates.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.93,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000035_000001",
      "target_sha256": "1c060c4f8982e130502bc6c0520a22eee487c3c98a30cf0b41ff934800e837bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-03",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Make me a cup of fresh coffee without milk.\"",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.07,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000040_000002",
      "target_sha256": "69d32c3364ba8271a98a58ce54f8593dc9908491afc0763857709353b49d7735"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-04",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"You are mad, she has given birth to a princess.\"",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.06,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000044_000000",
      "target_sha256": "bceae236e2c42bd5324c7c56b744ca8f546df9fb076e05aaaee1166ac2cd9f81"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-05",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I address him in Italian, and he answers very wittily, but his way of speaking makes me smile, and I tell him why.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.73,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000048_000001",
      "target_sha256": "336c74d8c1733256779df4ad5c8d48e3f743d21bb087b78fc7fb0d1d8801a22c"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-06",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "My new friend was a poet as I was; he was an admirer of Italian literature, while I admired the French.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.66,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000049_000000",
      "target_sha256": "3db7fcd27799e4d4b0d8ddcaecacb033a1568523afab5157a28575a29f06379d"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-07",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Therefore it is not a paradox to say that the French would be wiser if they were less witty.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.34,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000068_000004",
      "target_sha256": "70a37dcdbc0d7fb032207db2bf7f3ccdeaa6322973ad4ef66c310eff31d698f4"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-08",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "But, sir, how shall I find a teacher?",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.11,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000081_000001",
      "target_sha256": "eabdcfccdcd18aca124c06cdb0abfa83c04aafcf17f5e10e17a95154b25c7498"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-3729-09",
      "speaker": "3729",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The expression of Crebillon's face was that of the lion's or of the cat's, which is the same thing.",
      "target_audio": "3729/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.86,
      "target_source_id": "3729_6852_000084_000003",
      "target_sha256": "9cf56c70599e438c9ec22da329d0246930fac63aaf8b9ca852f78933dfa9cacd"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-00",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "There, far off, is my country, across the water.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.91,
      "target_source_id": "5142_33396_000002_000001",
      "target_sha256": "0aa53c19ca785744f46d627a343678049ba4bc8e53b1ae0dd123808ac8c4efd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-01",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"'This is my vow: I will sail to Norway and I will harry the coast and fill my boat with riches.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.39,
      "target_source_id": "5142_33396_000008_000000",
      "target_sha256": "d36f972a26ac0026c315fd8834008ea461a72cfc0d9b7556aa7dd0c18ccd3a8b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-02",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "We went to it, and I struck it with my spear.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.58,
      "target_source_id": "5142_33396_000022_000004",
      "target_sha256": "2f909089e702b57455ffd397df6bf8d6bca4218509d71ce7b5379ee7b97d6b93"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-03",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"'Ah!' another then cried out, sitting up.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.58,
      "target_source_id": "5142_33396_000038_000000",
      "target_sha256": "03df8fd5995c6e2874357a047c10d85b7286a5109cd93430b1f57f1f786f66a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-04",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"'And these shall follow your thralls in the same way.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.59,
      "target_source_id": "5142_33396_000051_000000",
      "target_sha256": "20db34a58711e9ebb5706a0427f6c182736f86e53e5fc12087a3133e1bafc4b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-05",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "On his right-hand side sat his sad and silent daughter.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.84,
      "target_source_id": "5142_36377_000006_000001",
      "target_sha256": "a27262442a0006e776743e725b4d6c8a2df4729915f58e477e83f228ba6e457f"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-06",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "A young lady quietly joined the party at the supper table.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.07,
      "target_source_id": "5142_36377_000011_000001",
      "target_sha256": "4cd90ddc66413bb5f077f55fabe87eaa56371ff992cfd41bb8bfef22c927e987"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-07",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "A more dreary and more disunited family party I never sat at the table with.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.41,
      "target_source_id": "5142_36377_000017_000005",
      "target_sha256": "ff182d8269caeed0352f981b773b1533137adbfc1df6a8cb8b20519e380f79be"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-08",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The races differ also in constitution, in acclimatisation and in liability to certain diseases.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.15,
      "target_source_id": "5142_36600_000007_000007",
      "target_sha256": "6953023d45d86bfec5a6da27b6a1f526c3994fda5d25b5e6afc1dd277729b159"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5142-09",
      "speaker": "5142",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The degrees of sterility do not coincide strictly with the degrees of difference between the parents in external structure or habits of life.",
      "target_audio": "5142/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.469958,
      "target_source_id": "5142_36600_000012_000003",
      "target_sha256": "a9367f97a5596b873db09db040aae242ca1fd584918394d10b61e21e511c2f1f"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-00",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"So ho!\" roared the monarch, \"you thought you could defy me, Earth Clod, did you?",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.04,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284447_000008_000000",
      "target_sha256": "dfd1adc7f34a16961d41481e3d87eaf3e525ff2016ac819a92493b6fe239bd09"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-01",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The frightened soldiers hurried away to find Tiggle, and Trot was well pleased because she knew Tiggle was by this time safely hidden.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.63,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284447_000016_000000",
      "target_sha256": "ea2876df007000fd1ce13d8ca27c7c2d64c20ae0405ae79d35a8f440ed87bf15"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-02",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The Captain of the Guards hesitated to obey this order.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.93,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284447_000028_000000",
      "target_sha256": "a19202aed6e2fa88d4e7ea601676d849eb3a6a5d3e4844c4e9416e3c210911a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-03",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The idea of patching Cap'n Bill to a goat was vastly amusing to him, and the more he thought of it the more he roared with laughter.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.08,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284447_000039_000001",
      "target_sha256": "90c581d88c12913b8c56db012ead785066c176fe55a7c4ab642cc503c3dc6a51"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-04",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Cap'n Bill rolled away in his frame and the knife fell harmlessly.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.529958,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284447_000048_000002",
      "target_sha256": "313df70e09449e7ee0d277f7ad41282758aa79326b14fff61a273dc62a4fd0ce"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-05",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "So Cap'n Bill held the Boolooroo, and the girl tied him fast in position, as Cap'n Bill had been tied, so that his Majesty couldn't wiggle at all.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.520042,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284447_000065_000001",
      "target_sha256": "0bb58466007beb9f74cec0115d7341bffedbc431dd837e9175f7fcfdd8a22617"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-06",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Trot had listened carefully to the Majordomo's speech.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.05,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284449_000024_000000",
      "target_sha256": "014c926e55a3355f951e62150fbdaa9afbdd68c6799b0952735c0a13fa0b1aa3"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-07",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "\"I'll gladly do that,\" promised the new Boolooroo; \"and I'll feed the honorable goat all the shavings and leather and tin cans he can eat, besides the grass.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.449917,
      "target_source_id": "8555_284449_000042_000000",
      "target_sha256": "19d16d46592ecb01b63eaf64b79557737d58a86d39a9f82ce0821f4bc499ccfe"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-08",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The other day at someone's tea we met, Smiling gayly, bowed, and went our several ways, Complacent with successful coldness.--Yet",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 11.34,
      "target_source_id": "8555_292519_000010_000000",
      "target_sha256": "f3a677efa9fb52673391f4b5a4b104a21de9ee86ac6abb21efe374ac06817bd6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-8555-09",
      "speaker": "8555",
      "gender": "F",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Desperately immortal, she; She stands With wide hands Dim through the veil of eternity, Behind the supreme door.",
      "target_audio": "8555/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.9,
      "target_source_id": "8555_292519_000048_000000",
      "target_sha256": "e1296d87db2e45ecbf20c298192f021d0b134dcc3436c68abbb7422f1f09eaea"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-00",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "After early nightfall the yellow lamps would light up, here and there, the squalid quarter of the brothels.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.97,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134686_000002_000001",
      "target_sha256": "126818e11fe80876ced5142e43e21fa53bcd80e4b9c2b19c122da9192a24bcf7"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-01",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Towards others he felt neither shame nor fear.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.8,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134686_000011_000001",
      "target_sha256": "ef311855ca8d7f48947af96b09764d248792e054c0078dbe5818be041f955d0b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-02",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "A tall boy behind Stephen rubbed his hands and said:",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.089958,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134686_000019_000000",
      "target_sha256": "3a7b3b255d629cf524efa4ca41b96e33b47c178434c057dc9f9e27d77ee077f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-03",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "On Friday confession will be heard all the afternoon after beads.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.32,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134686_000028_000002",
      "target_sha256": "6d18a061f23a4b7b2e25f1e4ddd100559f292ef80fa26d75cd47f668b9edb02b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-04",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "A great saint, saint Francis Xavier!",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.07,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134686_000032_000008",
      "target_sha256": "baf06554cc062c26ff48cbd76c5160d0c44a60ec0fe167566eec173c10a773e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-05",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The pride of that dim image brought back to his mind the dignity of the office he had refused.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.4,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134691_000007_000000",
      "target_sha256": "ee60d4f8a064f524fdf1012eb8569e112280f0126f0db60e0a1e02e2f121bf39"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-06",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The Europe they had come from lay out there beyond the Irish Sea, Europe of strange tongues and valleyed and woodbegirt and citadelled and of entrenched and marshalled races.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 10.81,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134691_000016_000002",
      "target_sha256": "ea4722e63f420e4401aa2cc8b15fa19469ba54358a0ba790216fd9898f72843b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-07",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "An ecstasy of flight made radiant his eyes and wild his breath and tremulous and wild and radiant his windswept limbs.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.02,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134691_000028_000003",
      "target_sha256": "d40882a01fc72064e60bab55c7da443c886111faca1ff02596c914781455745e"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-08",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Her slate blue skirts were kilted boldly about her waist and dovetailed behind her.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.690083,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134691_000045_000004",
      "target_sha256": "4d71499fae73590461cccc1675c5e585719159ea52e41f56f4ca10649f523ada"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-1089-09",
      "speaker": "1089",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "He climbed to the crest of the sandhill and gazed about him.",
      "target_audio": "1089/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.449958,
      "target_source_id": "1089_134691_000055_000000",
      "target_sha256": "b41952cee6b4ee577ccfc898f6755915c0e036a0b1e1d9047701843e8d211a3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-00",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "My head is still stupefied with the vivid reality of my dream.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.09,
      "target_source_id": "260_123286_000004_000000",
      "target_sha256": "8c1e197cf6ef2f85aff69af96836a84dd405642297f0b88718f58ea08ba9e5a1"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-01",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "On awaking, my first thought was to observe the intensity of the light.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.72,
      "target_source_id": "260_123286_000021_000004",
      "target_sha256": "04810ee5e4c428c69cb87179ba226e818905a2e300fcba5a6a5971a680e0f7f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-02",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "My uncle notices it, and looks on approvingly.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.93,
      "target_source_id": "260_123286_000035_000001",
      "target_sha256": "1e30d3b345af66926b3e4aedb46970d37b99fbe65d8827f198a95371ea7af036"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-03",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The plesiosaurus, a serpent with a cylindrical body and a short tail, has four flappers or paddles to act like oars.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.45,
      "target_source_id": "260_123286_000058_000000",
      "target_sha256": "c4922f05c1c46fcb8c3a9517cfe230ab295f18a84c6ad7ed18cbb73975b9f5b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-04",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Such is their ponderous weight that they cannot rise from the horizon; but, obeying an impulse from higher currents, their dense consistency slowly yields.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.36,
      "target_source_id": "260_123288_000006_000002",
      "target_sha256": "90dc6f4b7f2473ad480b7a0590a9c9af1ce07bc25a32a502531424bf3a785454"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-05",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The piled up vapours condense into water; and the air, put into violent action to supply the vacuum left by the condensation of the mists, rouses itself into a whirlwind.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 10.67,
      "target_source_id": "260_123288_000016_000001",
      "target_sha256": "c625b48f968331ffb5e705144b82f40229bdc37566cf64693531cd1d14c210d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-06",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The lightning flashes with intense brilliancy, and never seems to cease for a moment.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.57,
      "target_source_id": "260_123288_000027_000000",
      "target_sha256": "d1c57fb4b94341a39367396585952f7d59d72d6c293a6af064126d1ddc946483"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-07",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Mast and sail flew up in an instant together, and I saw them carried up to prodigious height, resembling in appearance a pterodactyle, one of those strong birds of the infant world.",
      "target_audio": "260/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 11.380042,
      "target_source_id": "260_123288_000038_000001",
      "target_sha256": "7f347442998d6d5c94831665d0d7bf08de27c233367fb26bdbfc326609e75e06"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-08",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Let me see: four times five is twelve, and four times six is thirteen, and four times seven is-oh dear!",
      "target_audio": "260/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.05,
      "target_source_id": "260_123440_000011_000004",
      "target_sha256": "8e94f1665d1c35b24fb54b7215cf057291f74c5efdd4ce46e778a0cbf23e05e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-260-09",
      "speaker": "260",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "So she called softly after it, 'Mouse dear!",
      "target_audio": "260/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.769958,
      "target_source_id": "260_123440_000026_000000",
      "target_sha256": "b035f1f863a17aa06853a815a1b79298928d7307fef141bb20c87696b4b65638"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-00",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "But Rodolfo had been struck by the great beauty of Leocadia, the hidalgo's daughter, and presently he began to entertain the idea of enjoying it at all hazards.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.94,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000000_000004",
      "target_sha256": "615d2d3717e07fb5cc8460567cb35a473e7258765eed6b331ed6df02721a14cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-01",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "It is the only amends I ask of you for the wrong you have done me.\"",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.52,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000003_000012",
      "target_sha256": "52701bd02228745f0cad0475e7347d784cc0b2f4fb4e88759e111a3d5632bdb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-02",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Among other things on which she cast her eyes was a small crucifix of solid silver, standing on a cabinet near the window.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.229958,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000007_000001",
      "target_sha256": "88d36e291b32d819257a110bbe2a5fcdd01276461a6f7ab6cf294f00d1fd47f6"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-03",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Real dishonour consists in sin, and real honour in virtue.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.16,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000010_000005",
      "target_sha256": "c0329776315a474fb416c6d9d6376c4a010bf1ebf3763a1c65e97c1fa49cc2df"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-04",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "One day, when the boy was sent by his grandfather with a message to a relation, he passed along a street in which there was a great concourse of horsemen.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.28,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000014_000000",
      "target_sha256": "7743f10c95f87f10730774a98d7f597ea94af445e1dc046a14589106db5f2fa5"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-05",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The master and mistress begged them not to cry, or raise their voices in lamentation; for it would do the little patient no good.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.790042,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000015_000003",
      "target_sha256": "3b6cfc29627f98d0d2e3df479ce7e4cb96eac2b7eb0e3558123c2a92b9705966"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-06",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "On seeing his wife all in tears, and Leocadia fainting, he eagerly inquired the cause of so startling a spectacle.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.660042,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000020_000001",
      "target_sha256": "f69e644fe115b4c06e459dcf1328293aea534fd5b248a8403d45e95971bbdb2b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-07",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "They added that Rodolfo told them, on the following day, that he had carried the girl to his own apartment; and this was all they knew of the matter.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.74,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000024_000003",
      "target_sha256": "169626eb07a05ed3aa9bcaf665d439aa60660e5b990012d2bd771792181f8609"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-08",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Her bearing was graceful and animated; she led her son by the hand, and before her walked two maids with wax lights and silver candlesticks.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.529917,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000028_000002",
      "target_sha256": "5b0598b3ddf3811bc6e335183590e9ade32a395c91ea17eea88a7d3f9cf06201"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-5639-09",
      "speaker": "5639",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "At last they sat down to a merry supper to the sound of music, for the performers, who had been previously engaged, were now arrived.",
      "target_audio": "5639/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.089833,
      "target_source_id": "5639_40744_000033_000000",
      "target_sha256": "b18f9cd48b4342ae115935dee31042eb6a4ef0bce0de9bd8fcd3d18944426047"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-00",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The bogus Legislature numbered thirty six members.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.1,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000002_000001",
      "target_sha256": "241646a4f94e9262057c3219bb5db054b8df3d91da17892b7275dad1e9e5710e"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-01",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Faithful to their legislative declaration they knew but one issue, slavery.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.55,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000004_000000",
      "target_sha256": "04a4697873a3c142cd97a07fb17e8d1a4bd8e8b9bf67291823d0c6189c5b2d49"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-02",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "There was no doubt of the earnestness of their purpose.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.87,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000010_000017",
      "target_sha256": "a16ba3579a7de6384cc80d8478595d98deb7964913d81e6293ec1338d297492f"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-03",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "With the advantage of its defensive position, Lawrence was as strong as the sheriff's mob.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.41,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000012_000007",
      "target_sha256": "da8153145a299794e4e03086c84038fa432a85c6a63e266cb8074c54376e7aec"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-04",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "In the Missouri camp while the leaders became alarmed the men grew insubordinate.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.63,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000016_000006",
      "target_sha256": "4ad2f4ef22678e7d8897716809283325c2d8c5958bf274f325081687a45e814b"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-05",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "There were similar murmurs in the pro slavery camps.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 2.690083,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000020_000002",
      "target_sha256": "6e3e01b1a8c474282e347d914148f44f97676ce0f0eaeacea55c46ee2a202ca9"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-06",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The people of Lawrence denounced the deed; but the sheriff hoarded up the score for future revenge.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.190083,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000025_000003",
      "target_sha256": "9feed0dbb49ee7ce69557e7f00a3db56f3aa6d93523fa90f0d944c9db59be280"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-07",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Their distinctive characters, however, display one broad and unfailing difference.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.160042,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000028_000004",
      "target_sha256": "de926890d2c164ba84451bc588558c68cbba8cbd7af2ab4410280593b3947bec"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-08",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The marshal and his posse, including Sheriff Jones, went among other invited guests and enjoyed the proffered hospitality.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.090083,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000035_000003",
      "target_sha256": "303a80d9f317bd19962bbe6b83df1187212900f0fc631dd4be74d61859f3e220"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-7729-09",
      "speaker": "7729",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "In a few days an officer came with a requisition from Governor Shannon, and took the prisoner by land to Westport, and afterwards from there to Kansas City and Leavenworth.",
      "target_audio": "7729/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 10.600083,
      "target_source_id": "7729_102255_000041_000002",
      "target_sha256": "84eb8d91142d9bea2885a74b705bd34b0ef5abe1a3503889b165911e80940236"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-00",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "born but to smile and fall. Ah!",
      "target_audio": "908/target-00.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 3.39,
      "target_source_id": "908_157963_000010_000001",
      "target_sha256": "9e7719eb6e4f5186b0e0b315a15a07d6871081029cfc535b7203919e18b3f0d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-01",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I see they lay helpless and naked: weeping And none to answer, none to cherish thee with mothers smiles.",
      "target_audio": "908/target-01.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 8.43,
      "target_source_id": "908_157963_000026_000001",
      "target_sha256": "c87c57ece1160ada715bafa79a3004381e1eaf1e9535420ac065115fb2af5a29"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-02",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "I miss the clear Fond voices which, being drawn and reconciled Into the music of Heaven's undefiled, Call me no longer.",
      "target_audio": "908/target-02.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 10.86,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000007_000001",
      "target_sha256": "f280b64933b65cedda8fe2b6769293d68356b345bcf90378cea1f518876d3cbf"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-03",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "If I leave all for thee, wilt thou exchange And be all to me?",
      "target_audio": "908/target-03.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 4.58,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000011_000000",
      "target_sha256": "6de6eabcdf4de41e5325e97d0d9ad30cb8d56dedc4360f4870549816c7528a4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-04",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "When we met first and loved, I did not build Upon the event with marble.",
      "target_audio": "908/target-04.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.01,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000013_000000",
      "target_sha256": "b156c4eb022f795c738861954dd84a388b9ea6bf184077e8842d079fe489b708"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-05",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Nay, I rather thrilled, Distrusting every light that seemed to gild The onward path, and feared to overlean A finger even.",
      "target_audio": "908/target-05.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 9.6,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000013_000002",
      "target_sha256": "db0a1f75e588e5276bde6ea04e35f7b84ed3ba44bb7a0323fde8838e94194ae8"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-06",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "A ring of amethyst I could not wear here, plainer to my sight, Than that first kiss.",
      "target_audio": "908/target-06.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 6.97,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000017_000001",
      "target_sha256": "fed76b462c73ea7f4901882fae3320cdb7577be0646527963a5be5b87fe80779"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-07",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "The second passed in height The first, and sought the forehead, and half missed, Half falling on the hair.",
      "target_audio": "908/target-07.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 7.03,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000017_000002",
      "target_sha256": "f0742d2172fa17c55db8b594d5c356c4e92eb0ab71b939c747d11625440f12fa"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-08",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Dearest, teach me so To pour out gratitude, as thou dost, good!",
      "target_audio": "908/target-08.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 5.55,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000019_000001",
      "target_sha256": "9c5d034762517b1ecd701411b1084ef0edee22deb0e23fbe8479c20024602231"
    },
    {
      "id": "spk-908-09",
      "speaker": "908",
      "gender": "M",
      "language": "en",
      "text": "Oh, to shoot My soul's full meaning into future years, That they should lend it utterance, and salute Love that endures, from life that disappears!",
      "target_audio": "908/target-09.wav",
      "target_duration_s": 10.12,
      "target_source_id": "908_31957_000023_000002",
      "target_sha256": "6dd5b524eeaacf1b206ddd3602b0524f2f958fa8800166bcc74f8b0af22f2b50"
    }
  ]
}
